{"id":"9ed6fa1ce1934897","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-dtime.md","title":"Deterministic Time","display":"df-dtime — Deterministic Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-computation]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"display":"df-dtime — Deterministic Time","label":"28-df-dtime","aliases":["28-df-dtime"],"type":"definition","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"25","source_pdf_pages":"51"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dtime — Deterministic Time"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-dtime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-dtime</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"25"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"51"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M,L(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M,L(M)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"256220eba4eba968\" href=\"?note=256220eba4eba968\" title=\"28-df-computation\">28-df-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(L=L(M)\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c\\,t(|x|))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书的常数因子约定。时间界有限，故机器每输入停机。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 1.12，印刷 p.25 / PDF p.51。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-computation","status":"resolved","id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on"